<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Leadership</h1>
<p>Skill
Class: Healer (guild level 0, up to 80%), Necromancer (guild level 3, up to 80%), Dark Knight (guild level 12), Paladin (guild level 12), Barbarian (guild level 15, up to 70%), Fighter (guild level 15, up to 50%), Ranger (guild level 16, up to 80%)
Practising it needs charisma 20.
</p><p>A born leader, or one who has studied the skill, is something of value to their 
group: people want to follow a real leader. Leadership is used by itself; there 
is no command for it.
</p><p>In a fight it does one thing: when you rescue someone who follows you (see 
<a cmd='#'>Help Rescue</a>), your leadership adds to your chance of succeeding. Some quests 
also ask for a skilled leader.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Rescue</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Groups</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Follow</a>
</pre>




</div>